# 2. PROJECT OVERVIEW

## System name

**CT-RSS Management System**

## Institution

Lapu-Lapu City College

## Initial deployment scope

College of Technology

## Purpose

Develop a centralized web-based system for managing the college's Recognized Student Service (RSS) activities, student participation, applications, attendance, service hours, accomplishment submissions, evidence documentation, verification, and official RSS reports.

The system will replace fragmented manual tracking with a centralized and organized digital workflow.

It must allow the authorized RSS Coordinator to manage student RSS activities and records while allowing students to monitor their own participation, applications, service hours, accomplishments, and progress.

The system must preserve official records, maintain a reliable audit trail, and ensure that only authorized and verified information is used in service-hour totals and official reports.

