## Registration workflow

1. Student completes registration.
2. System validates the submitted information.
3. System creates the account in pending status.
4. Student registration record is stored.
5. Coordinator receives a notification.
6. Coordinator reviews the registration.
7. Coordinator approves or rejects.
8. If approved, the account becomes eligible for access according to the approved account lifecycle.
9. If rejected, the rejection status is recorded.
10. Student receives a notification.
11. All review actions must be auditable.

